# 11. 상세 페이지 템플릿 만들기

이제 이번 편의 핵심인 `song_detail.html`을 만듭니다.

```html title="templates/music/song_detail.html"
{% extends "music/base.html" %}

{% block content %}
<section class="detail-page">
  <div class="detail-top">
    <div class="detail-main-card">
      <p class="detail-artist">{{ song.artist }}</p>
      <h1>{{ song.title }}</h1>

      <div class="detail-rating">
        {% for _ in "12345" %}
          {% if forloop.counter <= song.rating %}
            <span class="star filled">★</span>
          {% else %}
            <span class="star">☆</span>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="detail-comment-box">
        <h3>한줄 코멘트</h3>
        <p>{{ song.comment|linebreaksbr }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-meta">
        <p><strong>등록일</strong> {{ song.created_at|date:"Y-m-d H:i" }}</p>
        <p><strong>수정일</strong> {{ song.updated_at|date:"Y-m-d H:i" }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-actions">
